<p>Tether the target to the location for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">6, 6, 7, 7, 8</acronym> turns.  </p><p>Each turn the target has a 15% chance per tile it's travelled away from the tether to be teleported back, inflicting <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">60, 81, 98, 111, 124</acronym> physical and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">60, 81, 98, 111, 124</acronym> temporal (warp) damage to all enemies in a radius of <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">1, 1, 1, 1, 2</acronym> at both the entrance and exit locations.</p><p>The damage will scale with your Spellpower.</p>